# Environment for deploying the dashboard. From telemetry/dashboard/:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# wrangler loads .env from this folder by itself. Optional: after
# `npx wrangler login`, your browser login is enough. An empty `NAME=` would
# still be set, so the line stays commented out until you need it. .env is
# gitignored; never commit a real token.

# An API token, for deploying without a browser login (CI, a server).
# Create it at https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens with the
# "Edit Cloudflare Workers" template plus D1 Read permission.
# CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN=
